/data/1690820/000169082026000009/cvna-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Carvana Co. is a holding company that was formed as a Delaware corporation in 2016 in order to operate the business of Carvana Group, LLC and its subsidiaries (collectively, \"Carvana Group\"). Carvana Co. Class A common stock trades on the New York Stock Exchange (\"NYSE\") under the symbol \"CVNA.\"","zh":""},{"en":"Carvana is the leading e-commerce platform for buying and selling used cars. We are transforming the used car buying and selling experience by giving consumers what they want - a wide selection, great value and quality, transparent pricing, and a simple, no pressure transaction. Our differentiated business model combines a comprehensive online sales experience with a vertically integrated supply chain, designed to sell high-quality vehicles to our customers transparently and efficiently at a low price. The automotive retail industry is large – with approximately 37 million used auto retail transactions in the United States (\"U.S.\") in 2024 according to Cox Automotive – and highly fragmented – with the top 10 used auto retailers in the U.S. accounting for less than 10% of the market share in 2024. These dynamics create an exceptional opportunity for disruption that our custom-built busine","zh":"Carvana 是領先的二手車買賣電子商務平台。我們正在改變二手車買賣體驗，為消費者提供他們想要的東西——廣泛的選擇、超值和品質、透明的定價以及簡單、無壓力的交易。我們的差異化業務模式將全面的線上銷售體驗與垂直整合的供應鏈相結合，旨在以透明、高效、低價的方式向客戶銷售高品質車輛。汽車零售業規模龐大，根據 Cox Automotive 的數據，到 2024 年，美國（「美國」）的二手車零售交易量約為 3,700 萬輛，而且高度分散，到 2024 年，美國排名前 10 的二手車零售商所佔市場份額不到 10%。這些動態為我們的客製化業務帶來了顛覆性的絕佳機會"},{"en":"Vehicle Acquisition. We primarily acquire our used vehicle inventory directly from customers, used car auctions, including by use of our growing digital auction platform, and wholesale used vehicle suppliers, including retail marketplace partners. Acquiring inventory directly from customers when they trade in or sell us their vehicles in a one-way transaction eliminates auction fees and provides for a more diverse set of vehicles. After answering a few questions about the vehicle condition and features, our online tool provides customers with an automated, conditional offer for their existing vehicle that can be applied to any vehicle purchase or paid directly without an associated vehicle purchase. Our online tool then allows customers to schedule a time to have their existing vehicle picked up at their home, or drop it off at a Carvana location, and receive payment. We designed this pr","zh":"車輛採購。我们主要直接从客户、二手车拍卖（包括使用我们不断发展的数字拍卖平台）以及批发二手车供应商（包括零售市场合作伙伴）处获取二手车库存。当客户以单向交易方式向我们交易或出售车辆时，直接从客户那里获取库存，可以消除拍卖费用，并提供更多样化的车辆。在回答了有关车辆状况和功能的一些问题后，我们的在线工具为客户提供了针对其现有车辆的自动、有条件的报价，该报价可应用于任何车辆购买或直接付款，而无需购买相关车辆。然后，我们的在线工具允许客户安排时间在家中提取现有车辆，或将其放在 Carvana 地点，并接收付款。我們設計了這個項目"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Carvana is the leading e-commerce platform for buying and selling used cars. We are transforming the used car buying and selling experience by giving consumers what they want - a wide selection, great value and quality, transparent pricing, and a simple, no pressure transaction. Our differentiated business model combines a comprehensive online sales experience with a vertically integrated supply chain, designed to sell high-quality vehicles to our customers transparently and efficiently at a low price. The automotive retail industry is large – with approximately 37 million used auto retail transactions in the United States (\"U.S.\") in 2024 according to Cox Automotive – and highly fragmented – with the top 10 used auto retailers in the U.S. accounting for less than 10% of the market share in 2024. These dynamics create an exceptional opportunity for disruption that our custom-built busine","zh":"Carvana 是領先的二手車買賣電子商務平台。我們正在改變二手車買賣體驗，為消費者提供他們想要的東西——廣泛的選擇、超值和品質、透明的定價以及簡單、無壓力的交易。我們的差異化業務模式將全面的線上銷售體驗與垂直整合的供應鏈相結合，旨在以透明、高效、低價的方式向客戶銷售高品質車輛。汽車零售業規模龐大，根據 Cox Automotive 的數據，到 2024 年，美國（「美國」）的二手車零售交易量約為 3,700 萬輛，而且高度分散，到 2024 年，美國排名前 10 的二手車零售商所佔市場份額不到 10%。這些動態為我們的客製化業務帶來了顛覆性的絕佳機會"}],"competition":[{"en":"With tens of thousands of automotive retailers in the U.S., the used car marketplace is a highly fragmented and highly competitive industry. We believe the primary competitive factors in this market include transparency, convenience, price, selection, and vehicle quality. Our current and future competitors include:","zh":"美国拥有数以万计的汽车零售商，二手车市场是一个高度分散且竞争激烈的行业。我们认为这个市场的主要竞争因素包括透明度、便利性、价格、选择和车辆质量。我們目前和未來的競爭對手包括："},{"en":"internet and online automotive sites, such as Amazon, Autobytel, AutoTrader, Cars, Carfax, CarGurus, eBay Motors, Edmunds, Google, KBB, and TrueCar;","zh":""}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Used Vehicle Sales","val":14537000000,"zh":"二手車銷售"},{"name":"Wholesale Sales & Revenues","val":4052000000,"zh":"批發銷售和收入"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":1733000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":20322000000}},"peers":["UPST","AFRM","W","COIN","PTON"]}}